     Bottleneck : CPU FP32 turbo = 56 TFLOPS << GPU total FP32 = 268 TFLOPS
     Ratio      : 5x GPU/CPU
     Mitigation : Offload all FP32 workloads to GPU; CPU handles orchestration only.

